 "blockers": [],
 "notes": [
  "No login is needed. Every command is a public read.",
  "Workflow for provider docs: get-provider (namespace/name) returns numeric provider-version ids in 'included'; pass one to list-provider-docs, or to find-provider-doc with a category and slug; then pass the doc id to get-provider-doc for the markdown content.",
  "get-provider can return a large response for providers with many versions (hashicorp/aws). list-provider-versions gives version strings but not the numeric v2 ids.",
  "v2 endpoints are JSON:API: the useful fields sit under 'attributes', related records under 'included', and paging totals in 'meta.pagination'.",
  "Numeric ids differ from names: get-module-downloads takes the numeric module id from list-modules (23 = terraform-aws-modules/vpc/aws), and get-provider-downloads takes the numeric provider id (323 = hashicorp/aws).",
  "search-registry uses the site's public Algolia search key. Its page numbers are zero-based and its hit fields differ per index.",
  "search-modules uses offset paging: set offset to a multiple of limit (the default step of 15 assumes limit=15).",
  "Policy-library download stats are at /v2/policies/{namespace}/{name}/downloads/summary.",
  "Home-page featured lists are at /v2/providers/home and /v2/modules/home.",
  "Neither has its own command."
 ],
